                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">As an employee of the facility Level of Care Registry, a Licensed Vocational Nurse (LVN) may be requested to work on any shift, any day of the week and on any residence at the Developmental Center. Under the direction of supervisory staff, the incumbent provides direct care, treatment and developmental services for the clients where assigned. The services provided fall within the scope of the job as specified by the California State Personnel Board.<br /><br /><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, sans-serif; text-decoration-color: initial;">This is a 12 month Limited-Term position that may be extended to 24 months.<br /><br /><em>This position is not eligible for telework, this position is in person only.</em><br /><br /></strong></span><span style="font-size: 14pt;"><span style="font-size: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>Individuals interested in applying&nbsp;must&nbsp;take and pass the&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Licensed Vocational Nurse, California Department of Corrections and Rehabilitation</span>&nbsp;examination</strong>. <strong>To view the Exam Bulletin, click&nbsp;the following link or copy&nbsp;and paste&nbsp;the link into your web browser:</strong><br /></span></span><a href="https://cchcs.ca.gov/wp-content/uploads/sites/60/Careers/LVN-CDCR-O-C.pdf"></a></span><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917; font-size: 11pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Exams/ExamBulletin.aspx?ExamControlId=3321" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration: underline;">https://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Exams/ExamBulletin.aspx?ExamControlId=3321</span></a></span></strong></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span> <p><span style="font-size: 14pt;"><strong><em>Please tell us how you heard about us  (click on link below).</em></strong></span></p><p style="font-family: &quot;Microsoft Sans Serif&quot;; font-size: 14pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fforms.office.com%2Fg%2FEm8dGRc5Mt&amp;data=05%7C01%7CJulie.Mendoza%40pdc.dds.ca.gov%7C3a8556ba70714cc0a06a08dba81def37%7C7cfc5487eae84559b408d4e67432d3d2%7C0%7C0%7C638288618734412677%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=TEp7KIzyH6QAYurpyCBjcJwON1CqEXi52ncRIX3p%2Fp8%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="font-size: 14pt; text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #993300; text-decoration: underline;">https://forms.office.com/g/Em8dGRc5Mt</span></a></p><p>You will find additional information about the job in the <strong><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=26346785&name=LicensedVocationalNurseRegistry.pdf' target='_blank'>Duty Statement</a></strong>.</p>
                </p>
            
