ersonnel Office at the Porterville Developmental Center or completed and downloaded from the website indicated below.&nbsp;<strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">NOTE: All appointments are subject to State Restriction of Appointment (SROA), Departmental Restriction of Appointment (DROA), and Re-employment List procedures, pre-employment physical and fingerprint clearances. Further Information on the definition of the above may be found on the California State Department of Human Resources website at&nbsp;</strong><a href="http://www.calhr.ca.gov/" style="box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: none;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: blue;">www.calhr.ca.gov</span></strong></a><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">.</strong></span></span></span>
